ntity-Print-Website","date":"2026-11-05","about":["Eleven companies. One holding.","Kosan Holding is a business group in Erbil, Kurdistan Region, with eleven companies across six sectors: travel and pilgrimage, car rental and transport, oil and trade, driving instruction, printing and advertising, and humanitarian work. The brief was one identity for all of it.","A gold K cut from two chevrons on black, serif capitals (Bodoni Moda) with a quiet sans (Jost), and cream paper for print. The system runs from a 55 mm business card, letterheads, envelope and notepad to a 32-page A4 company profile in Kurdish, Arabic and English — and to kosanh.com, built in three languages with light and dark themes.","Scope: logo and mark system, stationery, editorial design, website design and front-end · Erbil · 2026.","یازدە کۆمپانیا. یەک هۆڵدینگ — ناسنامە، چاپەمەنی، پڕۆفایلی کۆمپانیا و وێبسایتی کۆسان هۆڵدینگ، بە سێ زمان."],"tools":["Adobe Illustrator"],"tags":["brand identity","Corporate Identity","company profile","editorial design","Stationery","Logo Design","Web Design","holding","Kurdistan","erbil"],"coverFile":"1f9001258104193.Y3JvcCwxNjE2LDEyNjQsMCww.png","cover":{"src":"/assets/behance/258104193/cover.webp?v=9372b6715c81","small":"/assets/behance/258104193/cover-404.webp?v=403234a173f1","w":808,"h":632},"images":[{"src":"/assets/behance/258104193/01.webp?v=0ff23ab268c1","w":1400,"h":1000},{"src":"/assets/behance/258104193/02.webp?v=e38c04bc9bf2","w":1400,"h":900},{"src":"/assets/behance/258104193/03.webp?v=11307b34e0d6","w":1400,"h":1040},{"src":"/assets/behance/258104193/04.webp?v=913037aa6d97","w":1400,"h":470},{"src":"/assets/behance/258104193/05.webp?v=5bb26c962007","w":1400,"h":980},{"src":"/assets/behance/258104193/06.webp?v=5f3d100d2737","w":1400,"h":1160},{"src":"/assets/behance/258104193/07.webp?v=550c6138b272","w":1400,"h":1600},{"src":"/assets/behance/258104193/08.webp?v=53852c3dabe3","w":1400,"h":1000},{"src":"/assets/behance/258104193/09.webp?v=97b5136899fa","w":1